      "closest_work_explanation": "Re3 is the most similar work as it proposes a unified framework that dynamically balances semantic and temporal information through a query-aware gating mechanism for temporal information retrieval. However, Re3 focuses on general temporal IR benchmarks (Re2Bench) and does not specifically address versioned regulatory documents for open-domain QA or the challenge of superseded clauses where temporal proximity determines clause validity.",
      "potential_contribution": "(1) A retrieval-agnostic framework for incorporating temporal dynamics into any document retriever for versioned regulatory text collections; (2) A benchmark of regulatory documents with overlapping revisions and time-stamped queries to evaluate temporal-semantic retrieval approaches for open-domain QA.",
